---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { navItems } from "../../../data/i18n";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Ethics and Professional Deontology - Víctor Cazorla Fernández"
  description="Professional ethics and deontology: chairing the Ethics Committee of the Catalan Association of Environmentalists and research in legal philosophy and normative logic."
  image="/images/og/deontologia.svg"
  imageAlt="Ethics and Professional Deontology — Víctor Cazorla Fernández"
  lang="en"
  navItems={navItems.en}
>
  <main class="container narrow">

    <h1>Ethics and Professional Deontology</h1>

    <section class="career">
      <div class="career-card">
        <div class="career-card__header">
          <img class="career-card__logo" src="/logos/coamb.jpeg" alt="COAMB logo" loading="lazy" />
          <div class="career-card__company">
            <strong>President of the Ethics and Deontology Committee</strong>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="career-card__role">
          <span class="career-card__specialty">Col·legi d'Ambientòlegs de Catalunya</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="editorial-text">
      <p>
        Since 2025 I have served as president of the Ethics and Deontology Committee of the Official Association of Environmental Scientists of Catalonia, the body responsible for ensuring the proper professional practice of more than one thousand registered scientists, managers, and environmental technicians in Catalonia.
      </p>

      <p>
        The exercise of this responsibility consists of coordinating a team made up of legal philosophy consultants and professional committee members, drafting opinions, interpreting and updating codes and regulatory frameworks, and institutional dialogue with the Governing Board, external public administration bodies, and companies.
      </p>

      <p>
        Being aware that the Committee’s work generates legal effects that require deliberation and therefore grounded criteria, I guide its practice to ensure responsible professional conduct consistent with the ethical principles that underpin the exercise of environmental sciences.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="editorial-text">
      <h2 class="section-subtitle">Research in Analytic Legal Philosophy</h2>

      <p>
        My work line is situated in analytic legal philosophy, with a focus on legal theory and normative logic: the logical structure of norms, the foundations of deontological authority, and the relationship between validity, applicability, and delegated normative power. The work is directed to peer-reviewed journals indexed in FECYT, Scopus, and ERIH PLUS.
      </p>

      <h3 style="margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600;">Published articles</h3>

      <div style="margin-bottom: 1.8rem; padding: 1rem; border-left: 3px solid var(--accent); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);">
        <p style="margin: 0 0 0.4rem 0; line-height: 1.6;">
          <strong>What obligates the professional? Normative foundations of deontological codes and their distinction from morality and law.</strong>
        </p>
        <p style="margin: 0; font-style: italic; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75); font-size: 0.95rem;">
          Cazorla Fernández, V. (in press). <em>Revista Jurídica de la UAM</em>, (54).
        </p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-bottom: 1.8rem; padding: 1rem; border-left: 3px solid var(--accent); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);">
        <p style="margin: 0 0 0.4rem 0; line-height: 1.6;">
          <strong>Normative logic and implicit tensions in deontological codes: formalization through standard deontic logic and input/output logic.</strong>
        </p>
        <p style="margin: 0; font-style: italic; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75); font-size: 0.95rem;">
          Cazorla Fernández, V. (in press). <em>Análisis. Journal of philosophical research</em>, 13(2).
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        style="
          margin-top: 2rem;
          padding: 1.4rem 1.6rem;
          max-width: 680px;
          border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
          border-radius: 14px;
          background: linear-gradient(
            180deg,
            rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04),
            rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015)
          );
          display: flex;
          flex-direction: column;
          gap: 1.2rem;
        "
      >
        <div>
          <a
            href="https://orcid.org/0009-0009-7976-9691"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            style="
              color: var(--accent);
              text-decoration: none;
              font-weight: 500;
            "
          >
            ORCID: 0009-0009-7976-9691
          </a>
          <p style="margin: 0.4rem 0 0 0; font-size: 0.9rem; opacity: 0.8;">
            Unique identifier in global scientific repositories
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <style>
      .career {
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
      }

      .career-card {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1rem;
        min-height: 100%;
        padding: 1.25rem;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
        border-radius: 16px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
        box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      }

      .career-card__header {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 0.9rem;
        padding-bottom: 0.8rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      }

      .career-card__logo {
        width: 64px;
        height: 64px;
        object-fit: contain;
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 0.5rem;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      .career-card__company {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.2rem;
        justify-content: center;
      }

      .career-card__company strong {
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        line-height: 1.35;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .career-card__role {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.35rem;
        justify-content: center;
      }

      .career-card__specialty {
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        opacity: 0.8;
        line-height: 1.5;
        letter-spacing: 0.01em;
      }
    </style>

    <section class="cards-grid">
      <h2>Interviews and public appearances</h2>

      <a
        href="https://www.coamb.cat/entrevistes/comite-etica-deontologia-coamb-victor-cazorla/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        style="display:block; margin:2rem 0;"
      >
        <img
          src="/entrevista-coamb-victor-cazorla.png"
          alt="Interview with Víctor Cazorla about ethics and professional deontology at COAMB"
          width="1700"
          height="700"
          loading="lazy"
          style="
            width:100%;
            max-width:720px;
            border-radius:14px;
            display:block;
            margin-bottom:1rem;
          "
        />
      </a>

      <p>
        <strong>Caring for people is caring for the profession.</strong><br />
        Interview published by the Col·legi d’Ambientòlegs de Catalunya (COAMB) about the creation of the Ethics and Deontology Committee, the role of professional ethics, and the need to provide professionals with protection mechanisms for complex conflicts in the exercise of the profession.
      </p>
    </section>

  </main>
</BaseLayout>
